# Corpus manifest -- the pinned input set for the four batch drivers.
# Regenerate: ./make-manifest.sh [root]
# Format: <sha256-16>  <bytes>  <path>
#
# batch.sh used to glob *.tzs without excluding the drivers' own scratch files, so its
# stored baseline included _ai_*.tzs from earlier AddField runs. Those can appear and
# disappear between runs, which made the baseline unreproducible. This list is the fix.

